Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1D-HYDRO-EXPECTATION", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.997462544893105*^9, 3.9974625476071987`*^9}, 
   3.997462813560791*^9, {3.997476393756893*^9, 
   3.9974763939833183`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ad509bca-b83d-4871-910a-\
29942821811e"],

Cell["\<\
The 1D-HYDRO-EXPECTATION test suite validates the analytical consistency of \
the hydrodynamic expectation values and energy decomposition principles \
within the 1D engine. The suite systematically proves that explicitly coded \
global expectation values\[LongDash]including Fisher information and both \
internal and convective components of kinetic and potential energies\
\[LongDash]perfectly match the exact symbolic infinite integrals of their \
corresponding local density fields across both position and momentum space. \
Furthermore, it rigorously confirms the hydrodynamic energy decomposition \
theorem by verifying that the total kinetic, potential, and overall system \
energies exactly decouple into their respective internal (quantum) and \
convective (classical) constituents.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.000410834240877*^9},ExpressionUUID->"dda98ec1-c2eb-4d86-b3ac-\
f51a2cf2e371"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

