Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1D-GWPObject-DISPATCH", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996335738629848*^9, 3.9963357454370737`*^9}, 
   3.996672469810019*^9, {3.996753015752389*^9, 3.996753019402701*^9}, 
   3.99675377733738*^9, {3.997470228440517*^9, 3.997470247968796*^9}, 
   3.997471411234437*^9, {3.997476378265678*^9, 
   3.997476378580739*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"11bde2f9-7db8-40a1-8146-\
7a38df41b259"],

Cell["\<\
The 1D-GWPObject-DISPATCH test suite verifies the \
framework\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Tier-3 object dispatching architecture by \
confirming that user-level property queries are accurately routed to the \
underlying low-level GWPTools mathematical functions. To guarantee exhaustive \
coverage, the suite is algorithmically generated directly from the package\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s internal function registries, systematically mapping out \
every available query. It evaluates these routings under both dynamic \
conditions (where an explicit time-dependent potential is active) and static \
conditions (where the wavepacket evaluates without a potential). Furthermore, \
it rigorously tests the system\[CloseCurlyQuote]s execution logic by ensuring \
that physical properties strictly requiring a dynamic potential safely \
trigger the appropriate fallback errors when queried on a static object.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.997471482872747*^9, {4.000410873476075*^9, 
   4.000410878336535*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8b301b92-06be-45c4-8498-\
ca1345aa883a"],

